# Operator wallet material for amoy_erc20_send test (Issue #515).
# `.enc` files are Argon2id + ChaCha20-Poly1305 encrypted mnemonics —
# recoverable with the wallet password (per polygon_amoy/README.md).
# Never commit. The runtime path is rebuilt by the operator from a
# trusted source (or via `polygon wallet create` / `wallet import`).
rust-wallet-app/crates/polygon/tests/polygon-data-amoy/

# Python bytecode (leak from e2e test scripts)
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Playwright MCP server cache
.playwright-mcp/

